TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Şey,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} sanırım artık yola düşme vaktim geldi!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}
Önemli bir şey konuşmadık gerçi,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
ama öylece takılmak
da eğlenceliydi!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}All right,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} I've been here long enough,
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}so I should really get going already.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
See you later! {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Pekâlâ,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} yeterince uzun kaldım,
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}artık gerçekten çıkmam gerek.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Sonra görüşürüz! {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Qué pasa? {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}¿Tienes que salir?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
¡No me dejes aquí solo!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Nada,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} me tendré que ir yo también.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Ha? {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Bir yere mi gidiyorsun?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Beni burada tek başıma bırakma!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Tamam!
Seninle geliyorum, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
